WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.410
Curiosity, climbing a mountain.

00:03.110 --> 00:11.204
Curiosity is the size of a small car and runs on the heat of plutonium, so dust on solar panels cannot stop it.

00:11.654 --> 00:20.766
Since 2012 it has been climbing a mountain of layered rock in the middle of this crater, reading a wet Mars turning into a dry one.
